  Not quite - the steps are :

       ./configure
       make LANGUAGES=c
       make stage1
       make CC="stage1/xgcc -Bstage1/" CFLAGS="-g -O" LANGUAGES=c
       make stage2
       make CC="stage2/xgcc -Bstage2/" CFLAGS="-g -O" LANGUAGES=c
       make compare
  if all is OK, then
       make install CC="stage2/xgcc -Bstage2/" CFLAGS="-g -O" LANGUAGES=c

 or you could read the INSTALL doc like everyone else.

