come on the firmware 3.1 CD, the revision matrix tells me that
ECU v1.6 is what corresponds to that release of the firmware.

So, which ECU disk *should* I used on our system: v1.6, or v1.7,
or can I use either one?  (I don't have *either* one yet, but it
