The SVR4 environment is available for OSF/1.  It is on one of the 
CD's you should have received when you got your system (unless you
got a pre-loaded system).  The SVR4 environment can be loaded with
or without the inclusive (links to SVR4 instead of BASE) view.
Without the inclusive view you have to set the PATH environment variable
and possibly the MANPATH environment variable if you want the SVR4 commands
to be available without specifying the full path (i.e. /usr/opt/svr4/bin/sar)
of the command to execute.  The setld product id is OSFSVE200 (this was
the last time I installed it.
Happy Hunting!
