/X. Now the question is how do I compile prog.c to include my own inc.h? inc.h
is included using "inc.h" rather than <inc.h>.

The most natural thing is:

cc -I. -c /X/prog.c -o prog.o

However this includes /X/inc.h still. So I then tried disabling the standard
include path and explicitly setting things:

cc -I -I/usr/include -I`pwd` /X/prog.c -o prog.o

