In article <3k5cj6$stv@male.EBay.Sun.COM> barroux@licancabur.ebay.sun.com writes:
>I need some help with the loader under OSF1 version 1.3 on a DEC alpha box.
>While trying to run an alpha binary called cdmenu from the mounted cd-rom, I
>get the following error message:
>
>cdmenu: /sbin/loader: Fatal Error: Main 's RLD_VERSION is 3, the correct version
>should be 2.

You are trying to run an OSF/1 V2.0 binary on V1.3. They are not downward
binary compatible (only upward). You should upgrade your machine to
OSF/1 V3.2 (which is out now), given that V1.3 is ancient and has some
pretty horrible bugs.

